
# =============================================================
# CRICKET HARMONICS VS TEMPERATURE - REPEATED RECORDINGS
# Species: Plebeiogryllus guttiventris
#
# LINEAR MIXED-EFFECTS MODELS:
# H2 amplitude (dB) ~ Temperature + (1 | CricketID)
# H3 amplitude (dB) ~ Temperature + (1 | CricketID)
#
# Uses one median H2/H3 measurement per recording.
# Multiple recordings from the same cricket are accounted for.
#
# GRAPH DESIGN:
# Blue points   = Individual measurements
# Orange points = Recording medians
# Green line    = Mixed-model fit
# Shaded area   = 95% confidence interval
#
# =============================================================


